OUTPUT PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift — covenant #9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt names the output dir `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/**`. That path is
NOT a project.yml `sources` group in this repo (xcodegen does not compile it). The real, COMPILED
canonical admin-page home is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/**` — where every live sibling P7
admin page ships (ApiPlayground, DiskForecast, FleetTelemetryCoverage, LiveSignalInspector,
SchemaDrift, TeslaOrders; apps/parity/apple-ledger.json shows them "done"), and which project.yml
lists as a `Sources` source path. The page therefore ships at `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/**`,
the faithful equivalent of the prompt's `Features/Admin`. Strings ship in the platform catalog
`apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings` (an allowed file). This is the SAME reconciliation the
SchemaDrift / DiskForecast sibling logs recorded.

ROUTE HOSTING: the web route is `/api-keys`. A dedicated `.apiKeys` AppRoute case is added
(pathSegment "api-keys", systemImage "key.fill", group .system). The generic AppRouteParser segment
match resolves `/api-keys` -> .apiKeys with no alias needed. `APIKeysRouteRegistration` hosts the page
on that route; it is composed into `\.routeHosts` in TeslaSyncApp.swift, so the page is reachable via
the System-group sidebar entry, the ⌘-menu Navigate command, Spotlight, and any `/api-keys` deep link.

